define the potential action<my.domain.com:my_lib:/consumer> {
    it also assigns the position</implied>.
    define the position<trigger>.
    define the position<sink>.
    it happens when {
        the position<trigger> has a particle.
    } and it does {
        move the particle in position</implied> to position<sink>.
        create a particle in position</implied>.
    }
}
